# Orquestrador — intenção

Responsabilidade: **palavras do pedido** → skill/command. Confirmar com stack/globs quando ambíguo. Só roteia (ler `SKILL.md` via `base`).

## Tooling e fluxo

| Intenção no pedido | Skill / command |
| --- | --- |
| commit, PR, merge, rebase | `git` |
| lint, eslint | `eslint` |
| format, prettier | `prettier` |
| deploy Vercel, vercel.json | `vercel`, `ci-cd` |
| deploy, pipeline, CI/CD | `ci-cd` |
| OKF, knowledge bundle, concept OKF | `okf` |
| `/onboard`, sync shared-ai | command `/onboard` |
| `/historico`, history watch, log/history de escopo | `history-watch` + command `/historico` |
| `/cursor-cli`, agent cli | command `/cursor-cli` |
| `/sync-inbox`, sync inbox | command `/sync-inbox` |
| `/automations`, Cursor Automation, automation draft | command `/automations` |
| `/criar-skill`, nova skill, scaffold skill | command `/criar-skill` |
| `/criar-rule`, nova rule, scaffold rule `.mdc` | command `/criar-rule` |
| monorepo, workspace, pnpm-workspace, turborepo | perfil/`SKILLS-ROUTING` monorepo + stack do pacote |
| review, auditoria, code review | tier 2 + `eslint`, `prettier`, `testing` + stack |

